    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "Lean-STaR works by **generating synthetic thoughts** using a powerful language model, such as GPT-4, and then **fine-tuning the model** with expert iteration. The process involves **retrospective rationale generation**, where the language model produces thoughts given the current state and ground-truth tactic. The **thought-augmented tactic prediction model** is then fine-tuned on the synthesized dataset, enabling the model to generate thoughts and predict subsequent tactics.",
