    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The results show that Lean-STaR **significantly outperforms base models**, achieving a pass rate of 36.1% on the miniF2F-test benchmark. The **thought augmentation** improves theorem proving, with the fine-tuned model achieving a pass rate of 32.8%. The **expert iteration** further improves the model's performance, with each iteration leading to increased pass rates.",
