    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "Lean-STaR has significant implications for **automated theorem proving**, as it enables language models to better understand the reasoning behind each step of a formal proof. The approach also has potential applications in **education and scientific discovery**, as it can facilitate the development of more intuitive and human-like reasoning systems. By **bridging the gap between informal and formal mathematics**, Lean-STaR can lead to breakthroughs in our understanding of mathematical concepts and their relationships.",
